# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node (in case anyone uses npm in the future)
node_modules/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Generated state from /setup-pipeline (per-fork; not shipped from canonical repo)
.claude/pipeline-setup.md

# Per-fork artifacts that shouldn't ship from the canonical repo.
# Forks of this repo running setup-pipeline locally will create:
#   .claude/commands/    (live skills, generated from templates)
#   docs/sprints/        (sprint manifests)
#   docs/protocol-test-runs/ (plan artifacts)
#   docs/debriefs/       (post-implementation writeups)
#   docs/plans/          (master plans)
#   tmp/                 (run logs)
#
# These directories are excluded from the canonical distribution but kept by
# each fork via that fork's local config. If you fork this repo and want to
# track those locally, remove the relevant entries below in your fork.
.claude/commands/
docs/sprints/
docs/protocol-test-runs/
docs/debriefs/
docs/plans/
tmp/
